    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it doesn't feel like a blank page though. it feels like the end. i just look at his side of the bed and i can't imagine doing this for another thirty years. it feels so irrational to keep trying when the person i was supposed to share everything with is just... gone. it feels like i'm just haunting my own life.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
